sequenceDiagram
    actor You
    participant H as Hydra
    participant M as Configured model
    participant T as Tool and workspace
    You->>H: Task and configuration
    H->>M: Request the next step
    M-->>H: Answer or proposed tool action
    H->>H: Validate and apply policy
    H->>T: Run permitted action
    T-->>H: Actual result
    H->>M: Continue with observed result
    M-->>H: Final answer within task limits
    H-->>You: Answer and recorded effects
